,51,74,23],[23779,13.8,2020,47,72,25],[23780,9.8,1956,53,70,30],[23781,8.1,1974,49,70,27]],"links":[["Carbon County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/utah/carbon-county"],["ARC or PLC in Carbon County","/arc-plc/utah/carbon-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Carbon County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 June to July got 17% of normal on the middle of the grids, and April to May got 55%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 146% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23179 had its driest year in 1956, at 43%.</p>"}
